# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; patterns are relative to the
# build context (the repository root). Only registry/registry.json and apps/gateway/{src,scripts,
# package*.json,tsconfig*.json} are copied, so everything heavy or unrelated stays out of the context.
.git
.github
docs
plugins
apps/portal
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
